  "content": "<center>\n\n<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/resourcepacks/fresh-umbrella-villagers/logo.webp?rnd=0.5864140410460041\" width=\"443\" alt=\"清新雨伞村民标志\"><br>\n\n## 给村民配上雨伞！- 现已支持全新动画！\n<br>\n\n[在我的网站上查看这个资源包！](https://ewanhowell.com/resourcepacks/fresh-umbrella-villagers)\n<br><br>\n\n<iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IrOIPxlY8Lk\" width=\"600\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe><br><br><br>\n\n[需要安装 Fresh Animations！](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fresh-animations)\n\n这个资源包让村民在下雨时能够撑起雨伞！\n\n包含24种不同的雨伞样式，村民生成时可能为左手持伞或右手持伞！\n\n现已支持全新动画！本资源包与 Fresh Animations 完全兼容！\n<br><br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1jJqpeSV/images/921f0242f33aa041630f2bc2f4472f4b1a19bc53.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"沼泽村民\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1jJqpeSV/images/cb35a0c7df53a6fc08522a08052d1d5f31665947.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"金色雨伞\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/1jJqpeSV/images/7f27cdd7f0f2a88eaf1c766ede70d5243d2dc062.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"对话场景\"><br><br>\n\n⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯\n\n[<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"> \n<br>\n<u>加入我的 Discord 服务器！</u>]( https://discord.ewanhowell.com/)\n<br><br>\n[<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/discord.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"> \n<br>\n<u>加入资源包开发 Discord 服务器！</u>]( https://resourcepacks.ewanhowell.com/)\n<br><br>\n[<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/youtube.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"> \n<br>\n<u>在 YouTube 上订阅我！</u>]( https://www.youtube.com/@EwanHowell)\n<br><br>\n[<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/twitter.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"> \n<br>\n<u>在 Twitter 上关注我！</u>]( https://twitter.com/ewanhowell5195)\n<br><br>\n[<img src=\"https://ewanhowell.com/assets/images/icons/ko-fi.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"> \n<br>\n<u>在 Ko-fi 上支持我！</u>]( https://ko-fi.com/ewanhowell)\n</center>"